{"ref":"BDB, בָּחַר","hw":"בָּחַר","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּחַר</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. choose (</strong>cf. Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחַר</span>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܚܰܪ</span> ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בחן</span>, Assyrian <em>bêru</em> (√ <span dir=\"rtl\">באר</span>) Dl<sup>Pr 76</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּחַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.6\">Dt 7:6</a> +; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְחַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.24\">Is 41:24</a> + 60 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֲחַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:25\" href=\"/Job.29.25\">Jb 29:25</a> (Baer); Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:9\" href=\"/Exodus.17.9\">Ex 17:9</a> + 5 times; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּחוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:28\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.28\">1 S 2:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.15\">Is 7:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.16\">16</a>; Inf. cstr. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּהֳרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.5\">Ez 20:5</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּחֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:30\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.30\">1 S 20:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.2\">Zc 3:2</a>; pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּחוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:7\" href=\"/Exodus.14.7\">Ex 14:7</a> + 18 times;— <strong>1.</strong>  with <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>, <strong>a.</strong>  <em>divine choice</em>, of Abraham <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.7\">Ne 9:7</a>; Israel <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.7\">Dt 7:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.1\">Is 44:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.5\">Ez 20:5</a>; to become his people <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.6\">Dt 7:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.2\">14:2</a>; Jeshurun <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.2\">Is 44:2</a>; the seed of the patriarchs <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:37\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.37\">Dt 4:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.15\">10:15</a>; Levites <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.5\">Dt 18:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.5\">21:5</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.2\">1 Ch 15:2</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.11\">2 Ch 29:11</a>; Aaron <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:26\" href=\"/Psalms.105.26\">ψ 105:26</a>; Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.4\">1 Ch 28:4</a> not Ephraim <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:67\" href=\"/Psalms.78.67\">ψ 78:67</a>; Levi and Judah <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.24\">Je 33:24</a>; the king <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.15\">Dt 17:15</a>, especially David <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.24\">1 S 10:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.8\">16:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.10\">10</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.21\">2 S 6:21</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.16\">1 K 8:16</a> (= <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.6\">2 Ch 6:6</a>) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.4\">1 Ch 28:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.1\">29:1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.5\">2 Ch 6:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:70\" href=\"/Psalms.78.70\">ψ 78:70</a>; others <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:5\" href=\"/Numbers.16.5\">Nu 16:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:20\" href=\"/Numbers.17.20\">17:20</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:23\" href=\"/Haggai.2.23\">Hg 2:23</a>; place of sacrifice <a data-r