erbs.21.3\">Pr 21:3</a>.<br><strong>Pu.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבֻחַר</span> <em>chosen, selected</em> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.4\">Ec 9:4</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">יְחֻבַּר</span> Qr).","next":"BDB, בָּחוּר","prev":"BDB, בחיניו"}